    "customerDeposits": "Segment depositFraction comes from the same decision. A commissioned build collects half the agreed price before any part is bought; standard machines are built to stock and collect nothing early.",
    "startingRoutes": "opening.<difficulty>.startingRoutes lists the routes open in month one. Hard opens with the boutique route only, per the same user decision. The unlock condition for the mass route is not yet decided.",
    "limits": "A deterministic scenario calculator, not a playable six-month balance validation. Demand, delivery timing and quality feedback are assumptions."
